    "text": "13 hours ago SILOAM SPRINGS, ARK. - The skeletal remains of Gypsy Camp for Girls remind of a legacy that time has changed, and perhaps faded, but not erased. It was here — on the banks of the Illinois River in the very northwest corner of Arkansas — where generations of campers gathered each summer for more than 50 years. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
